@startuml
!include ../../_common/style.puml
title L1：普通消息消费核心流程

actor Application
participant MessageTemplate
participant DestinationResolver as Resolver
participant MessageProviderRegistry as Registry
participant MessageProvider as Provider
participant MessageWireCodec as Codec
participant MessageContextAccessor as Context
participant MessageHandler as Handler

Application -> MessageTemplate: subscribe(definition, handler)
MessageTemplate -> Resolver: resolve(definition.destination)
Resolver --> MessageTemplate: ProviderDestination
MessageTemplate -> Registry: getRequired(providerName)
Registry --> MessageTemplate: Provider
MessageTemplate -> Provider: subscribe(ProviderSubscriptionRequest)
Provider --> Application: MessageSubscription

== 每次投递 ==
Provider -> MessageTemplate: onMessage(ProviderInboundMessage)
MessageTemplate -> Codec: decode(definition, destination, inbound)
Codec --> MessageTemplate: DecodedInbound
MessageTemplate -> Context: open(CurrentMessage)
MessageTemplate -> Handler: handle(envelope, consumeContext)

alt Handler 返回 SUCCESS
  Handler --> MessageTemplate: SUCCESS
  MessageTemplate -> Context: close()
  MessageTemplate --> Provider: SUCCESS
else Handler 返回 RETRY
  Handler --> MessageTemplate: RETRY
  MessageTemplate -> Context: close()
  MessageTemplate --> Provider: RETRY
else Handler 抛出运行时异常
  Handler --> MessageTemplate: exception
  MessageTemplate -> Context: close()
  MessageTemplate --> Provider: RETRY（一期保守策略）
end

note over MessageTemplate,Handler
本图仍是消费一期主流程。
消费可靠性、消费重试、DLQ、消费幂等属于后续阶段。
end note
@enduml
